# L §8.3 Which refusal prints (tally 2.1.1): load reads every file before it splits any into tokens. a.tally comes
# first by its path and its grammar fails; z.tally doesn't exist: LOAD-PATH prints, since reading comes first.
=== options disk missing=z.tally
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== a.tally
part pa
  tally 2

def y int 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PATH z.tally doesn't exist
